Then you get to be surprised, because it is not; it's a "ci vy"
amount of lemons:

rlpowell@chain> echo "ci vy nimre cu dunda mi" | camxes
text
   sentence
   |- sumti5
   |  |- number
   |  |  |- CMAVO
   |  |  |     PA: ci
   |  |  |- CMAVO
   |  |        BY: vy
   |  |- BRIVLA
   |        gismu: nimre
   |- CMAVO
   |     CU: cu
   |- bridiTail3
      |- BRIVLA
      |     gismu: dunda
      |- CMAVO
            KOhA: mi

i.e. {ci vy nimre} is the x1, and {mi} is the x2.

-Robin

